Alternatives Considered
Uploading a single large .rsc file via /file/add.
Uploading a single large .rsc file via /file/set contents.
Implementing API-level chunking and file reconstruction.
Using external transfer protocols such as FTP, SFTP, or SCP.

While these approaches remain potential options, splitting configurations into multiple files with a generated master script is expected to be the most reliable and maintainable solution within current MikroTik API constraints.

